# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite
# these to CRLF on checkout. A shell script with CRLF endings fails inside a
# Linux container with `exec format error` / "no such file or directory" — an
# error that names the interpreter, not the line endings, so it is a genuinely
# nasty half-hour. Pin them.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
